Package: shinyOAuthDB
Title: Bridge Shiny User Authorizations to Database and Data Platform Clients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Luka", "Koning", email = "koningluka@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Thin Shiny bindings from 'shinyOAuth' user authorizations to
    native database connections and token providers. Supplies reactive accessors
    for existing client packages with per-session connection reuse and cleanup.
    Login and token refresh stay in 'shinyOAuth'; queries and results stay in
    the native database package and application.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB
BugReports: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
